          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP229 Viking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The last time I was through here I was pulling an RV trailer and couldn't manage a turn around here.

No such issues today and another cap find is mine.

Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
